{"parentUuid": null, "isSidechain": false, "promptId": "01ad31c8-10f0-4245-b1bb-4ff2e50b95c0", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "experiment time. i have 12 long transcripts in experiments/transcripts/ where i hand-tagged the decisions that mattered (lines with `DECISION:` in my notes file, decisions.yaml). i want to know how many of those decisions survive (a) claude code's built-in auto compaction summary vs (b) an hc note where i marked segments. the summaries are already saved as experiments/auto/<id>.md and experiments/hc/<id>.md. write the scoring script: for each decision, ask whether it's recoverable from the summary. use simple keyword matching first, we can do an llm judge later"}, "uuid": "85d619f1-d11c-43a2-abc0-d7bb41c96e14", "timestamp": "2026-08-15T04:30:42.406Z", "permissionMode": "default", "userType": "external", "entrypoint": "cli", "cwd": "/Users/divadbaroon/Projects/claude-plugins", "sessionId": "57e81dcf-628e-44d8-a92a-841652f9c2a9", "version": "2.1.225", "gitBranch": "compaction-exp"}
{"parentUuid": "85d619f1-d11c-43a2-abc0-d7bb41c96e14", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5", "id": "msg_01EY6vJSWAMI7wmt18lgEGhC", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_013e5CHdEAG4JDPFu1pTgZU1", "name": "Bash", "input": {"command": "ls experiments/ experiments/transcripts | head; head -20 experiments/decisions.yaml", "description": "Look at experiment layout and decisions file"}}], "stop_reason": "tool_use", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1174, "cache_read_input_tokens": 20420, "output_tokens": 62, "service_tier": "standard"}}, "requestId": "req_011CKaFHQZJnlv8ARbUlNw7G", "type": "assistant", "uuid": "379f3643-e2c0-4896-ba42-8f0cd5dea55b", "timestamp": "2026-08-15T04:30:49.201Z", "userType": "external", "entrypoint": "cli", "cwd": "/Users/divadbaroon/Projects/claude-plugins", "sessionId": "57e81dcf-628e-44d8-a92a-841652f9c2a9", "version": "2.1.225", "gitBranch": "compaction-exp"}
{"parentUuid": "379f3643-e2c0-4896-ba42-8f0cd5dea55b", "isSidechain": false, "promptId": "01ad31c8-10f0-4245-b1bb-4ff2e50b95c0", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_013e5CHdEAG4JDPFu1pTgZU1", "type": "tool_result", "content": "experiments/:\nauto\ndecisions.yaml\nhc\ntranscripts\n\nexperiments/transcripts:\nt01.jsonl\nt02.jsonl\nt03.jsonl\nt04.jsonl\nt05.jsonl\nt06.jsonl\nt07.jsonl\nt08.jsonl\nt09.jsonl\n\nt01:\n  - id: t01-d1\n    text: use pnpm not npm in the canvas repo\n    keys: [pnpm]\n  - id: t01-d2\n    text: card ids are ulids, never array indexes\n    keys: [ulid]\n  - id: t01-d3\n    text: do not touch electron main process files\n    keys: [electron, main process]\nt02:\n  - id: t02-d1\n    text: dates in exports are UTC with Z suffix\n    keys: [utc, Z suffix]"}]}, "uuid": "896787a1-8485-4d81-a4b1-5fd554c93b5e", "timestamp": "2026-08-15T04:30:52.385Z", "userType": "external", "entrypoint": "cli", "cwd": "/Users/divadbaroon/Projects/claude-plugins", "sessionId": "57e81dcf-628e-44d8-a92a-841652f9c2a9", "version": "2.1.225", "gitBranch": "compaction-exp"}
{"parentUuid": "896787a1-8485-4d81-a4b1-5fd554c93b5e", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5", "id": "msg_016F3fpkhovEAWN4eqTF6KjH", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01JWcui5sgeRCsaaGdeb6DPK", "name": "Write", "input": {"file_path": "/Users/divadbaroon/Projects/claude-plugins/experiments/score.py", "content": "\"\"\"Score how many hand-tagged decisions survive each compaction summary (keyword recall).\"\"\"\nimport json, re, sys, yaml\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nE = Path(__file__).parent\nDEC = yaml.safe_load(open(E / \"decisions.yaml\"))\n\n\ndef recovered(dec, summary):\n    s = summary.lower()\n    return all(re.search(r\"\\b\" + re.escape(k.lower()) + r\"\\b\", s) for k in dec[\"keys\"])\n\n\ndef main():\n    rows = []\n    for tid, decs in sorted(DEC.items()):\n        for arm in (\"auto\", \"hc\"):\n            p = E / arm / f\"{tid}.md\"\n            if not p.exists():\n                continue\n            text = p.read_text()\n            hit = sum(recovered(d, text) for d in decs)\n            rows.append({\"t\": tid, \"arm\": arm, \"decisions\": len(decs), \"kept\": hit, \"words\": len(text.split())})\n    for arm in (\"auto\", \"hc\"):\n        r = [x for x in rows if x[\"arm\"] == arm]\n        k, n = sum(x[\"kept\"] for x in r), sum(x[\"decisions\"] for x in r)\n        w = sum(x[\"words\"] for x in r) / max(1, len(r))\n        print(f\"{arm:>4}: {k}/{n} decisions kept ({k / n:.0%}), mean summary {w:.0f} words\")\n    json.dump(rows, open(E / \"scores.json\", \"w\"), indent=1)\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}}], "stop_reason": "tool_use", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1448, "cache_read_input_tokens": 22840, "output_tokens": 358, "service_tier": "standard"}}, "requestId": "req_011CdDlma96UJrqr1np77Uar", "type": "assistant", "uuid": "0b808847-6d82-4f43-b254-1bff5b6861e9", "timestamp": "2026-08-15T04:30:58.958Z", 